News received from those involved in carrying out the party's decisions Powerfully promoting the Pungnam Mine Development Corporation 2.８Vinalon United Enterprise takes action to implement the decision of the 9th Party Congress..８Vinalon Joint Enterprise workers and the working class are vigorously pushing for the Pungnam Mine Development Corporation..
Crushing in an area with inexhaustible deposits of high-quality limestone, The working class of the joint enterprise that built the ore processing system, including the Sabyeol process, is stubbornly pushing ahead with construction work such as extending the railway line in cooperation with the relevant unit..
Dear Comrade Kim Jong-un said the following:.
《Performance in economic work depends on how to activate the revolutionary enthusiasm and creativity of the masses who are responsible for it..》
The joint enterprise officials are keeping in mind the significance and importance of the development of the Pungnam Mine in expanding the chemical product production capacity and are conducting construction in a revolutionary manner..They are not only setting up a command force for mine development, but are also going to the field and actively carrying out political and ideological work to arouse the public to implement the party's decisions. They are also specifically understanding the problems raised and developing countermeasures immediately..
The workers and the working class mobilized for the development of the Pungnam mine are demonstrating the revolutionary spirit of self-reliance and stubbornly breaking through all the obstacles that stand in their way..１serial crushing, Having learned a lot of experience and lessons while conducting a trial run of the bereavement process, they are exploring and introducing reasonable work methods and vigorously promoting the second series of construction..
Pungnam Mine workers take a leading position, establish close ties with relevant units, and vigorously push forward with the assembly and installation of major facilities while using their own technicians., We are focusing on the business of increasing functional capacity..
The construction of housing for employees, which is another battleground in the development of the Pungnam Mine, is also progressing vigorously..
Kim Il-sung before - Kim Jong-il's Research Laboratory, Workers' camp, Day care kindergarten, clinic, The working class of the joint enterprise that built the miner's house is now speeding up the construction of hundreds of employees' living quarters..
Pungnam-ri, which was quiet in the past, is now emerging as a promising limestone production base, as the foundation for securing the livelihood of miners is being established along with the production system that has been carved out of the mountain top and firmly established..
2 people who came together as one in the struggle to accelerate and end the development of the Pungnam mine..８Vinalon Joint Enterprise workers and the working class continue to increase their forward momentum..
Amid the ongoing struggle to implement the decisions of the 9th 1st Plenary Meeting of the Party Central Committee at the Pochon Naegok Power Plant construction site, the construction of the Pochon Naegok Power Plant in Ryanggang Province is accelerating at a rapid pace..
According to the comprehensive data, the results of waterway tunnel expansion and covering construction are much higher than in previous months due to the high revolutionary enthusiasm of provincial officials and builders..
In early May, the provincial party committee organized a council of workers at the construction site to qualitatively complete power plant construction in the shortest possible time..
The council said the facility, Problems with ensuring materials on time, There was a serious discussion of countermeasures that would arise in concluding waterway excavation work, which is key in power plant construction, as soon as possible, including the issue of rational organization of labor..
The entire province's attention is focused on the power plant construction site..
The workers of the Bochon Naegok Power Plant Construction Brigade are organizing and carrying out construction operations and commands in a vacuum and powerful manner, with a firm focus on political work to further heighten the enthusiasm of the construction public..
Hyesan Steel Plant, Hyesan Cement Plant is raising its voice to increase production to secure materials for power plant construction..
Kim Chaek University of Technology, Scientist at the 1st Power Design Research Institute of the Ministry of Electric Power Industry and Energy, researcher, Planners are fighting a battle to secure scientific and technological collateral to accelerate construction., We are actively conducting technology wars..
The spirit of great deeds is rising at the water tunnel construction site..
２Provincial Investigation Management Bureau in charge of the gang, The provincial land environmental protection management bureau companies are actively introducing new technological innovations and constantly improving construction performance..３Tao-Kwang Industrial Complex, in charge of the gang, Docheshin Management Bureau, Provincial trade management bureau companies are also adopting advanced methods and speeding up work significantly compared to before..４Hyesan Youth Mining Company, in charge of the mine, successfully carried out a trial run of the hoisting machine for transporting goods and secured collateral to speed up construction..
Not to be outdone, the water intake tower, The Provincial People's Committee and Provincial Forest Management Bureau companies in charge of spillway construction are also recording high performance in vertical shaft expansion and covering concrete installation..
